 tcmalloc/parameters.cc                                                                                                  | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tcmalloc/testing/want_disable_separate_allocs_for_few_and_many_objects_spans_test_helper.cc                             | 37 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
